{%- comment -%}
  Runs inside `_layouts/bib.liquid` (al_folio_core), between the point where
  `additional_info` is appended to `entrytype` and the point where `periodical`
  is assembled. The layout then prints `{{ entrytype }}, {{ entryyear }}`.

  1. Strip `entrytype`. The layout pipes `additional_info` through
     `markdownify`, which leaves a trailing newline, so the comma before the
     year rendered with a stray space ahead of it ("… under review , 2026").

  2. Add volume, issue and pages, which the layout never prints. When an entry
     has any of them, the year moves into `entrytype` and `entryyear` is
     emptied, giving the ACS-style line
       Journal of the American Chemical Society, 2025, 147(43), 39113–39122
     Entries with none of them (preprints, under review) are left as they were.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign entrytype = entrytype | strip -%}
{%- if entry.volume or entry.number or entry.pages -%}
  {%- capture citation_detail -%}
    {%- if entry.volume -%}{{ entry.volume }}{%- endif -%}
    {%- if entry.number -%}({{ entry.number }}){%- endif -%}
    {%- if entry.pages -%}
      {%- if entry.volume or entry.number -%}, {% endif -%}
      {{- entry.pages | replace: '--', '–' -}}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture entrytype -%}{{ entrytype }}, {{ entry.year }}, {{ citation_detail }}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign entryyear = '' -%}
{%- endif -%}
